			],
			"Message": "chore(Monorepo): Synchronize elements with documentation audits and development builds\n\nThis commit advances all major submodules to their latest commits, introducing comprehensive documentation frameworks and restoring development tooling across the Land ecosystem.\n\n## Documentation Frameworks\n\n### Air & Cocoon: 50-Level Deep Analysis Templates\n- **Air**: Added comprehensive 50-level audit template to Library.rs covering structure verification, module analysis, code quality checks, convention verification, and refactoring priorities\n- **Cocoon**: Introduced 50-level analysis checklist in OldStyleServices.ts with TODO inventory breakdown (267 TODOs across language server, providers, and document handling)\n- Both templates provide in-source tracking mechanisms for ongoing quality assurance efforts\n\n## Mountain: RPC Alignment & DTO Fixes\n- **RPC Service**: Aligned Mountain's RPC service with Vine gRPC protocol contract - corrected field names in debug logs (e.g., `RegisterTreeViewProviderRequest`: `display_name` → `extension_id`)\n- **DTO Deserialization**: Fixed deserialization of DialogOptions DTOs (InputBox, OpenDialog, SaveDialog) by properly wrapping objects in `Value::Object`\n- **Bootstrap Integration**: Added `Badge:None` to TreeViewStateDTO\n- **Cleanup**: Removed redundant re-exports and added missing imports\n\n## Build Tooling Restoration\n\n### Wind & Worker: Development Builds\n- **Wind**: Regenerated development build artifacts with readable formatting and source maps for debugging\n- **Worker**: Restored development-readable builds (4x size increase: ~2.6KB → ~10.3KB) with full source map support\n- Both elements revert from production minification to enable better debugging visibility\n\n### Rest: Binary Rebuild\n- Rebuilt Rest binary after OXC migration to reflect latest compiler features and NPM packaging changes\n\n## Impact\n\nEstablishes self-documenting audit systems in Air/Cocoon, ensures Mountain correctly interprets gRPC requests per Vine protocol, and restores development debugging capabilities for Wind/Worker. Maintains consistency across the entire Land monorepo.",
			"SHA": "84674de56214377a1b19e1214f74e6248ceab921"
